\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Internal structure validation, $480$ paired trials per SNR point. (a)~Unconditional (bold) and inlier-conditional (faint) position RMSE with the matched data-only free-Jones PEB. (b)~Catastrophic rate \eqref  {eq:pcat} with exact $95\%$ Clopper--Pearson intervals. (c)~Clock RMSE (bold) and p95 (faint). (d)~Jones-domain channel NMSE. R2 and R3 differ only in Phase~II and their curves nearly coincide, showing that the error tail is set by the initializer rather than by the inner solver.}}{16}{}\protected@file@percent }
